# Registry steward (process zero)

The registry runs itself through this runbook. Every other runbook is created or changed by it.

## Outcome

Every automation the team runs is defined here in one shape, with an owner, a version, and a QA gate wherever a deliverable crosses a boundary.

## Start a run

A request to add, adopt, change or retire a process. Begin at `01-intake`.

## Stage map

| Stage | Does | Needs | Gate |
|---|---|---|---|
| `01-intake` | Turns the request into a short brief | none | no |
| `02-author` | Writes or edits the runbook and its QA criteria on a branch | `01-intake` | yes |
| `03-publish` | Opens the pull requests, merges on pass, updates the route, syncs | `02-author` | no |

Order and gates come from `process.yaml`. Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root to run it.

## Done means

The change is merged in both repos, `ROUTE.md` is current, lint is clean, and the task record carries the new version.
